<title>USA: Microtel Intl Q4 shr loss widens to $1.32.</title>
<headline>Microtel Intl Q4 shr loss widens to $1.32.</headline>
<dateline>ONTARIO, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTel International Inc.</p>
<p>			Summary Results of Operations</p>
<p>For the Three Months and Year Ended Dec. 31, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>		   (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				    Three Months		 Year</p>
<p>				  1996	 1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>Sales			 $ 4,264   $ 4,261    $16,303   $18,352</p>
<p>Net loss		    $(3,656)  $  (670)   $(4,597)  $ (667)</p>
<p>Net loss per share	$ (1.32)  $ (0.25)   $ (1.65)  $ (0.25)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p> shares outstanding	 2,769     2,729	2,783     2,678</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes charges of $3.0 million, or $1.10/shr, for severance costs, inventory write-downs and litigation settlements.</p>
